{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q4677960","formula":"C₅₆H₃₈O₃₁","hill":"C56H38O31","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":56.0,"H":38.0,"O":31.0},"names":{"en":"Acutissimin A"},"descriptions":{"en":"Acutissimin A is a flavono-ellagitannin, a type of tannin formed from the linking of a flavonoid with an ellagitannin. In 2003, scientists at Institut Européen de Chimie et Biologie in Pessac, France found that when the oak tannin vescalagin interacts with a flavanoid in wine acutissimin A is created. In separate studies this phenolic compound has been shown to be 250 times more effective than the pharmaceutical drug Etoposide in stopping the growth of cancerous tumors."},"fame":8,"pubchemCid":44559699,"mass":1206.9,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1[C@@H]([C@H](OC2=C1C(=CC(=C2[C@@H]3[C@@H]4[C@@H]5[C@@H]6[C@@H](COC(=O)C7=CC(=C(C(=C7C8=C(C(=C(C=C8C(=O)O6)O)O)O)O)O)O)OC(=O)C9=CC(=C(C(=C9C1=C(C(=C(C(=C1O)O)O)C1=C(C3=C(C(=C1O)O)O)C(=O)O4)C(=O)O5)O)O)O)O)O)C1=CC(=C(C=C1)O)O)O","inchikey":"DRHVFLXLYQESEQ-YGJAGGILSA-N","iupac":"(1R,2S,20R,42R,46R)-46-[(2R,3S)-2-(3,4-dihydroxyphenyl)-3,5,7-trihydroxy-3,4-dihydro-2H-chromen-8-yl]-7,8,9,12,13,14,25,26,27,30,31,32,35,36,37-pentadecahydroxy-3,18,21,41,43-pentaoxanonacyclo[27.13.3.138,42.02,20.05,10.011,16.023,28.033,45.034,39]hexatetraconta-5,7,9,11,13,15,23,25,27,29(45),30,32,34(39),35,37-pentadecaene-4,17,22,40,44-pentone","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"44559699","atoms":125,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-3.777,"y":-4.135,"z":-2.868,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.823,"y":-3.585,"z":-1.907,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.927,"y":-2.07,"z":-2.135,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.684,"y":-1.396,"z":-1.918,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.528,"y":-2.007,"z":-2.339,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.521,"y":-3.314,"z":-2.862,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.325,"y":-3.808,"z":-3.39,"el":"C